&quot; /&gt;</ph><ph id="4">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;
&quot; /&gt;</ph>&lt;p&gt;As a result, translators are forced to work with &lt;b&gt;overly long and complex segments&lt;/b&gt; that mix multiple sentences or ideas.&lt;/p&gt;<ph id="5">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;
